config BUZZER_STM8
	bool "STM8 beeper"
	default y
	depends on SOC_SERIES_STM8S
	depends on DT_HAS_ST_STM8_BEEP_ENABLED
	select PINCTRL
	help
	  Enable the hardware beeper with nonblocking tones and automatic stop.
	  The output has fixed duty and maps nonzero volume to its audible level.
	  The LSI clock source and pin remap must match the option bytes.
